<view class="page">
  <view class="heading"><text class="eyebrow">先学会，再慢慢整理</text><text class="title">{{kind === 'practice' ? '我的练习录像' : '现场示范录像'}}</text><text class="subtitle">{{targetCardId ? '保存后会关联到当前动作，回到动作卡即可查看。' : '把复诊现场的示范和自己的练习分开记录，之后再配到动作卡片。'}}</text></view>
  <view class="card card-green"><text class="card-title">这次想保存哪一种？</text><view class="choices"><text class="pill {{kind === 'demonstration' ? 'pill-active' : ''}}" data-kind="demonstration" bindtap="chooseKind">现场示范</text><text class="pill {{kind === 'practice' ? 'pill-active' : ''}}" data-kind="practice" bindtap="chooseKind">本人练习</text></view><text class="muted">录像仅保存在本机当前账号下，不会上传。换设备或清理小程序数据后不能恢复，请保留原片。</text><view class="row"><button class="button compact" disabled="{{saving || choosing}}" bindtap="chooseCamera">{{kind === 'practice' ? '录下我的练习' : '现场录动作'}}</button><button class="button button-plain compact" disabled="{{saving || choosing}}" bindtap="chooseAlbum">从相册选择</button></view><text class="small">拍摄前请征得出镜者同意，单段不超过 50 MB。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{file}}" class="card"><text class="card-title">检查这段{{kind === 'practice' ? '练习' : '示范'}}</text><video class="recording-video" src="{{file.tempFilePath}}" controls="{{true}}" binderror="onVideoError" /><view class="field"><input value="{{title}}" maxlength="80" placeholder="起个名字，方便以后找到（可不填）" bindinput="onTitle" /></view><button class="button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">{{targetCardId ? '保存到当前动作' : '保存为待整理'}}</button><button class="button button-plain" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="discardSelection">暂不保存这一段</button></view>
  <view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">{{targetCardId ? '这个动作的本机录像' : '我的本机录像'}}</text><text class="small">{{pendingCount}} 段待整理</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card empty">正在读取本机录像…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!recordings.length}}" class="card empty">还没有保存录像。可以先录示范，之后再整理到动作卡片。</view>
  <view wx:for="{{recordings}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="pill">{{item.kind === 'practice' ? '本人练习' : '现场示范'}}</text></view><text class="small">{{item.dateLabel}} · {{item.sizeLabel}} · {{item.cardId ? '已配动作' : '待整理'}}</text><video wx:if="{{item.available}}" class="recording-video" src="{{item.filePath}}" controls="{{true}}" binderror="onVideoError" /><text wx:else class="missing-note">本机文件已不可用，可删除这条记录后重新录制。</text><button wx:if="{{item.available}}" class="button button-plain" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openMatch">{{item.cardId ? '更换配对动作' : '配到动作卡片'}}</button><button wx:if="{{item.cardId}}" class="button button-plain" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{!!busyId}}" bindtap="unmatch">取消配对，留作待整理</button><button class="button button-danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{!!busyId}}" bindtap="remove">删除本机录像</button></view>
</view>
